# Verification

- After edits: check Lint / IDE diagnostics on touched files. That is enough unless told otherwise.
- Do **not** build or run the project (`./gradlew`, Assemble, install, emulator) unless the user explicitly asks.
- Never add, generate, expand, or propose unit/instrumented tests or new `*Test.kt` under `app/src/test` / `androidTest`.

Full policy: `docs/agents/verification.md`.
